  "synopsis": "The hero, gifted with extraordinary abilities and from a powerful Daoist sect, left his sect at his master's invitation to exorcise ghosts. After clearing two haunted houses, he became entangled in a series of bizarre events while facing challenges from various factions: he clashed with a Thai sorcerer, dealt a crushing blow to Japanese Onmyoji, fended off a Korean witch's challenge, and humiliated Western exorcists—defeating and banishing masters from across the world. In a realm where technology intertwined with the supernatural, he slayed demons and spirits, growing into a legendary Celestial Master.\n\n(Source: Youku)",
